From 8fcf17b82567796e4f1cca5cd8d53dcfe7f27575 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 23 May 2026 04:19:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Apply GCTU SIP design system consistently across all screens
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Transforms the entire frontend from the dark navy/gold theme to the
official GCTU Student Information Portal (SIP) Soft UI Design System:

Design system changes (index.css + index.html):
- Load Open Sans 300/400/600/700 via Google Fonts
- Add CSS custom properties: --sip-dark (#344767), --sip-text-body
  rgb(103,116,142), gradients, shadows, radii
- Add reusable .sip-card, .sip-btn-dark, .sip-input helper classes
- Light scrollbar styling

Login pages (full redesign to match erp.gctu.edu.gh/sip/):
- White/light-gray page background (#f0f2f5)
- Dark gradient hero banner (310deg #141727→#3A416F) with "Welcome!"
  heading at 48px bold, campus watermark overlay
- Centered white card (16px radius, 0 20px 27px rgba shadow)
- GCTU crest logo + institution name + tagline
- Soft UI inputs (1px #d2d6da border, 8px radius, placeholder-as-label)
- Dark gradient SIGN IN button (12px uppercase, drop shadow)
- Minimal footer with GCTU nav links and copyright

All dashboard pages + components:
- Background: #00122c → #f0f2f5
- Sidebars/cards: dark navy → white with border-gray-200
- Headings: text-white → text-[#344767] (dark navy)
- Body text: text-slate-400/500 → text-[#8392ab]
- Gold accent (#D4A017) → SIP dark navy scheme
- Primary buttons: gold → linear-gradient(310deg,#14172B,#3A416F)
- Active nav items: dark blue → SIP gradient dark (white label)
- Modal overlays: near-black → bg-black/40 backdrop-blur
- Toast notifications: dark translucent → white cards with colored borders
- Spinners, SVG strokes: gold → #344767
- Removed dark gradient blob decorations

